xt-white">9/10</div><div class="mono text-[10px] text-white/40">aciertos</div></div><button class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-white text-black font-bold grid place-items-center hover:bg-[#00FFCC]">+</button></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00FFCC] to-[#FF00AA] transition-all" style="width: 90%;"></div></div><div class="mt-2 flex justify-between mono text-[10px] text-white/30"><span>0</span><span>umbral 8</span><span>10</span></div></div></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="rounded-[12px] bg-[#0A0A0F] border border-white/5 p-4"><div class="mono text-[10px] text-white/40">BINOMIAL p-value (H0: p=0.5, n=10)</div><div class="mono text-[22px] font-bold text-white mt-1">p = 0.0107</div><div class="mono text-[11px] text-white/40 mt-1">P(≥9 aciertos | azar)</div></div><div class="rounded-[12px] bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 p-3 mono text-[11px] leading-[1.6] text-white/50"><div class="flex justify-between"><span>k=8</span><span class="text-white/70">p=0.0547</span><span class="text-amber-300">borderline</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>k=9</span><span class="text-white/70">p=0.0107</span><span class="text-[#00FFCC]">sig</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>k=10</span><span class="text-white/70">p=0.0010</span><span class="text-[#00FFCC]">sig fuerte</span></div></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-[20px] opacity-40" style="background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.12), transparent 35%, rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.12));"></div></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="relative rounded-[20px] border bg-[radial-gradient(120%_120%_at_0%_0%,rgba(255,255,255,0.08),transparent_60%)] backdrop-blur-xl border-[#00FFCC]/20 shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(0,255,204,0.08),0_0_40px_rgba(0,255,204,0.08)] p-5"><div class="mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40 mb-3">AUDITORÍA VERIFICADA</div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div class="text-center"><div class="mono text-[22px] font-bold text-white">142</div><div class="mono text-[10px] text-white/40">módulos Kotlin</div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="mono text-[22px] font-bold text-white">204</div><div class="mono text-[10px] text-white/40">endpoints JNI</div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="mono text-[22px] font-bold text-[#00FFCC]">23</div><div class="mono text-[10px] text-white/40">CTest</div></div></div><div class="mono text-[11px] text-white/40 mt-4 leading-[1.5]">gammatone stability, denormals low level, DSP core stability. Null-tests + spectrogram diferencial OpenGL.</div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px rounded-[20px] opacity-40" style="background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.15), transparent 40%, transparent 60%, rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.05));"></div></div><div class="relative group rounded-[12px] overflow-hidden border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0A0A0F]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02]"><span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] font-mono text-white/40 uppercase">ABX LOGS</span><button class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/60 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition">COPY</button></div><pre class="p-4 overflow-x-auto text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] font-mono text-[#C8E6FF]/90"><code>docs/listening_tests/abx_logs/
